    {
      "id": "claim_88c43267cb9f471fbccc88f98acd83f7",
      "statement": "To replace the default behavior completely, you can implement ErrorController and register a bean definition of that type or add a bean of type ErrorAttributes to use the existing mechanism but replace the contents.",
