    {
      "id": "claim_f98d7bd543c9436997b8719ecf893a3c",
      "statement": "If you want to display a custom HTML error page for a given status code, you can add a file to an /error directory. Error pages can either be static HTML (that is, added under any of the static resource directories) or be built by using templates. The name of the file should be the exact status code or a series mask.",
